pqHSM
This product is a derivative work of FreeHSM C (above), ported to Rust under
modernized/pqHSM/. The attribution above is kept as Apache-2.0 section 4
requires. The FreeHSM and Simorgh Labs names and logos are not licensed
(section 6) and are not used to brand pqHSM.

The Rust build links these crates statically (`cargo tree -e normal` of the
module, the service and the tools; build-time crates are not linked):

  * openssl 0.10 (Apache-2.0)
  * openssl-sys 0.9 (MIT): Copyright (c) 2014 Alex Crichton; its notice is
    LICENSES/MIT.txt
  * bitflags 2, cfg-if 1, foreign-types 0.3, foreign-types-shared 0.1,
    libc 0.2, zeroize 1 (each MIT or Apache-2.0, used under Apache-2.0)

